hed there was a \"loot all\" button to simply take all materials a container has. Would be even more time saving if we could automatically loot materials we are searching for and include some quantity tracker for items in warehouse when you select an item in the backpack while out of the base.", "timestamp_created": 1787412858, "timestamp_updated": 1787412858, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233408752", "author": {"steamid": "76561198125484952", "personaname": "JAVERY779", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198125484952/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 4264, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4225, "last_played": 1787391537, "avatar": "0102aa0f41849afce9e5694775cc03668a3c8014"}, "language": "english", "review": "a well craft game, many unexpected thing (in a good way)", "timestamp_created": 1787389271, "timestamp_updated": 1787389271, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}]}